    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHROMADI\u00a0is a retro arcade shoot-'em-up video game where you mix and match colours to blast your enemies and defend the RAINBAR from running dry.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[The game is in active development, several features of the game are still a work in progress. We are working on it, thank you]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Description :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JOIN THE CHROMA CREW TO PROTECT THE RAINBAR</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MIX &amp; MATCH COLOURS LIKE NEVER BEFORE!\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SIMPLE TO GET STARTED, QUITE HARD TO BEAT THE HIGHSCORE.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUNDREDS OF UNIQUE COMBINATIONS TO KEEP EVERY RUN UNIQUE &amp; CHALLENGING</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AN ALL NEW YET FAMILIAR CLASSIC ARCADE TITLE FOR YOU TO SET A WORLD RECORD IN</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AN ICONIC SOUNDTRACK BY DARKGRAY FOR YOU TO VIBE TO</p></li></ul>",
